    {
      "id": "55b51110",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Adding nonlinearity\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5b6d717b",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Nonlinearity can be simulated in various ways. One method is to use the `tanh` (hyperbolic tangent) function, which has a number of desirable characteristics:\n\n* it is simple to implement,\n* it passes through the origin,\n* it is almost linear near the origin.\n\nThese properties allow the degree of nonlinearity to be controlled (in terms of the maximum deviation from a straight line $y=x$).\n\nThe figure shows a graph of the function $y=\\text{tanh}(x)$, illustrating small deviations from linearity near the origin.\n\n<center>\n\n![3 график функции tanh.png](attachment:3 график функции tanh.png)\n\n</center>\n\nFirst, the input signal must be attenuated to limit the range; then, the hyperbolic tangent function must be applied to it; and finally, it must be amplified to compensate for the previous attenuation.\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "3 график функции tanh.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "268035b6",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务5\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c6a05622",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Add nonlinearity:\n\n1. Add the following blocks to the model, which can be found in the **Basic** -> **Math Operations** library:\n\n* **Gain**,\n* **Trigonometric Function**,\n* another **Gain** block.\n\n2. Connect these blocks as shown in the diagram:\n\n<center>\n\n![4-13.png](attachment:4-13.png)\n\n</center>\n\n3. To ensure that the signal level remains constant, the gains of the two  **Gain** blocks must be reciprocal with respect to one another. Therefore, in the settings window of the first **Gain** block, set the value of the parameter **Gain** to `0.2`, and for the second **Gain** block to `1/0.2`.\n\n4. In the settings window of the **Trigonometric Function** block, set the value of the parameter **Function** to `tanh` (hyperbolic tangent).\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解决方案</span></h5>\" %}\n\n<center>\n\n![4-14.png](attachment:4-14.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "4-13.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "4-14.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "748d1024",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Quantizer output saturation\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cefcaf31",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "To simulate a real ADC, you need to set the quantizer output saturation. To do this, you will need the **Saturation** block, which can be found in the **Basic** -> **Discontinuities** library.\n\n<center>\n\n![4-15.png](attachment:4-15.png)\n\n</center>\n\nThis block produces an output signal that is the input signal clipped at the top and bottom. The upper and lower bounds are set by the parameters **Upper limit** and **Lower limit**. If the input signal values exceed the upper limit, the output signal takes the value of the upper limit. If the input signal values are less than the lower limit, the output signal takes the value of the lower limit.\n\nTo limit the output signal to the range $1$，在**量化器**模块之后添加**饱和**模块。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "4-15.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "18f6218c",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务6\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "db87827e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "对量化器输出信号添加饱和处理：\n\n1. 将 **Saturation** 模块添加到模型中。将其连接在 **Quantizer** 和 **Terminator** 模块之间。\n2. 在模块设置窗口中，将 **Zero-Crossing Detection** 参数的值设置为 `Enable`。其他模块参数保持默认值：**Upper limit** 为 `0.5`，**Lower limit** 为 `-0.5`。\n4. 记录模型输出信号。\n5. 运行模型。在频域中绘制输出信号。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![4-16.png](attachment:4-16.png)\n\n</center>\n\n输出信号频谱：\n\n<center>\n\n![4-17.png](attachment:4-17.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "4-16.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "4-17.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
